{"reviews":[{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-0","r":5.0,"t":"This product was amazing!","x":"I couldn\u2019t believe how well this product worked. I started seeing ants in the living room and kitchen.  I ordered these and placed them throughout my house and in the basement.  I haven\u2019t seen a thing since.  I\u2019m going to order more!","h":199,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-1","r":5.0,"t":"Roach Candy","x":"This product is excellent!!! It works within second\u2019s and believe me, I saw it with my own eyes. These nasty creatures are so attracted to this product that they don\u2019t mind if you walk right next to them while they eat it. Best of all is that right after they eat it you see the effectiveness and Hasta la Vista Baby!!!","h":181,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-2","r":5.0,"t":"Smell","x":"it smells like garlic very strong but it helps alot","h":175,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-3","r":5.0,"t":"Works Great!","x":"The product arrived on time and worked like a charm. Just take out the canister, apply the provided quality 3M adhesive pad and stick to your desired location. After placing mine in the engine compartment of my vehicle I haven't had any critters setting up shop in places one wouldn't want. After months of use the product still retains a strong scent (that isn't too much for a human but is definitely noticeable for a rodent.) Very satisfied.","h":172,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-4","r":5.0,"t":"Worked for us!","x":"We saw mice poop all over our car, but since we started using this product no sign of mice!","h":170,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-5","r":5.0,"t":"Answers to my prayers!","x":"I had to order this product again!!!! This worked all to well......Thank you I haven't seen a mouse since. This is a must buy.","h":168,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-6","r":5.0,"t":"It smells nice","x":"I like this product I haven't seen a mice since I placed in my home. And the smell isn't on that will over power your home like tradition repellents","h":164,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-7","r":5.0,"t":"Thank you. Mosquitto problem solved","x":"i live in spain barcelona and thanks to TSCTBA Repelente de mosquitos i can use my pool and patio again. I will buy more.","h":164,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-8","r":5.0,"t":"Works Great","x":"I live in a wooden area and rodents enter may basement when the weather gets colder.  This product worked great!  I didn't see any evident of rodent activity this past winter.  Thanks!","h":163,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-9","r":5.0,"t":"Rodent","x":"Once placed on at the vehicle I didn\u2019t smell it.","h":162,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-10","r":5.0,"t":"Say, \u201cNO\u201d to mouse condos!","x":"I\u2019m happy with the product.  Adheres well, and will save me $$$ No more chewed wires!","h":156,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-11","r":5.0,"t":"Effective and safe but pungent","x":"we had mice in the house over the winter and traps work but since we put the repellent around, the mice have disappeared BUT it's a strong scent and while it dissipates over time, it can be kind of noxious (but why it works) so put them in places where mice travel but pets, children do not","h":126,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-12","r":5.0,"t":"Decent stuff with good results","x":"Quite an interesting scent! (expected with the scent combo on these things) I'd say worked pretty well. I mean you have to manage your expectations because this is neither magic nor engineered chemicals, so not going to be poof and they are gone. I really noticed a huge drop in traffic after setting a few of these out (gladly the mice are only in my garage currently). Still would notice some so set out more (in combination with a spray with the same ingredients as these balls) and it has been pr","h":109,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-13","r":5.0,"t":"Simple to setup for car","x":"The windshield hose in our car had few bite holes and when I got it fixed, they suggested getting a rodent repellent for the car and that's how I ended up buying this. It's been a week or so since I have set this up using the 2 side 3M stickers and so far it is still sticking to the inside the hood of my car. The smell is strong and do not recommend it for using inside the car where people sit.","h":105,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-14","r":5.0,"t":"It Works!!!!","x":"Easy to install, Scent does NOT go into the driving cabin\u2026most of ALL\u2026it works!!!","h":103,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-15","r":5.0,"t":"Rodents are gone!","x":"Rodents ate thru the computer wires in my car.  Expensive fix. Now using rodent repellent with no signs of there return. I\u2019ll continue using this product in the future.","h":102,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-16","r":5.0,"t":"Worked like a charm!","x":"No more rats in my engine, this was great & easy to use!","h":102,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"We have mice that keep making nests in our car and chewing on our fuel tank costing us lots of money. I'm thankful for a safe option that we can use as a deterrent!","h":86,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-18","r":5.0,"t":"Effective","x":"Purchased to put in our shed and it makes a difference","h":86,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-19","r":5.0,"t":"No more mice!","x":"Put this several in the back patio and on some doors. I had not seen any activities on my camera since I use this. It worked!","h":84,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-20","r":5.0,"t":"Smells good","x":"This product actually smells pretty good like essential oils! Stuck easily in the engine of my car too","h":83,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"My husband used this product and said \"This was so cool. I would use it again to repel the rodents\"","h":79,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BTLTVR1X-22","r":5.0,"t":"Works well-safe for 